# Line endings are normalised to LF, everywhere, always.
#
# This repo is edited from three places now: a Windows workstation, GitHub, and
# the admin tool on a Linux box. Without this, each writes its own convention
# and a file round-trips as a whole-file diff.
#
# That is not cosmetic here. The publish flow depends on a human reading the
# diff before it reaches every installed phone, and a diff full of invisible
# line-ending churn is a review that does not happen. artists.json had already
# drifted to CRLF in the blob this way.
* text=auto eol=lf
